      "example": "61ccbdb06fa83012be4d8083f6****,7d2fbc380b0e08e55f****",
      "help_en": "The media IDs, which are the audio or video IDs (VideoId). Separate multiple IDs with commas (,). You can specify up to 20 IDs. You can obtain the IDs by using one of the following methods:\nFor audio or video files uploaded through the console, log on to the ApsaraVideo VOD console (https://vod.console.aliyun.com) and choose Media Library > Audio and Video to view the audio or video IDs.\nWhen you call the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/55407.html operation to obtain the upload URL and credential, the value of the VideoId response parameter is the media ID.\nAfter an audio or video file is uploaded, you can call the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/86044.html operation to query the media ID. The value of the VideoId response parameter is the media ID",
      "help_zh": "媒体ID，即音/视频ID（VideoId）。多个ID之间使用半角逗号（,）分隔，最多支持20个。可通过以下方式获取：\n通过控制台上传的音/视频，可登录点播控制台 (https://vod.console.aliyun.com)，选择媒资库 > 音/视频查看音/视频ID。\n通过https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/55407.html接口获取上传地址和凭证时，为返回参数VideoId的值。\n音/视频上传后，可通过https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/86044.html接口查询，为请求后返回参数VideoId的值",
